  "steps": [
    "Preheat the oven to 200°C. If you prefer, you can also finish the cod on the hob with a lid instead of baking it.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large ovenproof pan over medium heat. Add the onion and peppers with a pinch of salt and cook for 8 to 10 minutes, stirring often, until softened and starting to sweeten.",
    "Stir in the garlic, smoked paprika and oregano, then cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the chopped tomatoes, water, remaining salt and black pepper. Simmer for 8 to 10 minutes until the peppers are tender and the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Nestle the cod fillets into the pepper sauce and spoon some sauce over the top.",
    "Transfer the pan to the oven and bake for 10 to 12 minutes, until the cod is opaque and flakes easily.",
    "Scatter over the parsley and serve with lemon wedges."
  ],
